{"matched":64,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0283c01","n":"0283c","t":"為有三能相也重言之有為者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0284a01","n":"0284a","t":"何故生滅等合名無常以有非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0284b01","n":"0284b","t":"生等非離於法有體亦然謂立"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0284c01","n":"0284c","t":"相亦然亦有有者有無者故有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0285a01","n":"0285a","t":"令後果弱不及前法其滅可知"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0285c01","n":"0285c","t":"功能及過去有與果功能而非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0286a01","n":"0286a","t":"知此並如菩薩地四十六卷說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0286b01","n":"0286b","t":"立不同剎那望前後法述曰總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0286c01","n":"0286c","t":"文字亦是色之屈曲然色之屈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0287a01","n":"0287a","t":"別生名此即且就他宗為論且"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0287b01","n":"0287b","t":"即能別生名者且就彼計申自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0288a01","n":"0288a","t":"者即是字也字即語故說之為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0288b01","n":"0288b","t":"體亦非不可言故而今乃言名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0288c01","n":"0288c","t":"行者色上屈曲非不相應聲何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0289a01","n":"0289a","t":"小乘不信有他方佛何故以此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0289b01","n":"0289b","t":"故如現行貪等此中貪嗔癡一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0290a01","n":"0290a","t":"心等如燈日月照色等法以色"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0290b01","n":"0290b","t":"如前一處色合處餘處色不合"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0290c01","n":"0290c","t":"得非擇之法問何故難空令色"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0291a01","n":"0291a","t":"若諸無為非實是有何故經中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0291c01","n":"0291c","t":"顯故若真如名所詮非如體何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0292a01","n":"0292a","t":"處五識無邊處六無所有處七"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0292b01","n":"0292b","t":"等三性依他等攝安立非安立"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0292c01","n":"0292c","t":"又無違自宗等我不許緣彼心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0293a01","n":"0293a","t":"答能持自體說名為法即一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0293b01","n":"0293b","t":"外道以佛性為我此不相似非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0294a01","n":"0294a","t":"親唯內相故諸法執皆緣內心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0294b01","n":"0294b","t":"外道小乘皆在此破他聚者謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0294c01","n":"0294c","t":"能自緣也彼部心等不自緣故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0295a01","n":"0295a","t":"火不可說人似於火故然似事"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0295b01","n":"0295b","t":"無後破似事共法亦無述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0295c01","n":"0295c","t":"德等亦得說為火者於水等中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0296a01","n":"0296a","t":"等德非共有故此中總非下顯"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0296b01","n":"0296b","t":"准前立三法故今破也或是外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0296c01","n":"0296c","t":"名共相一色蘊該十故於一處"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0297a01","n":"0297a","t":"相而轉此之自相證量所知非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0297b01","n":"0297b","t":"根合得自相豈能以聲得彼自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0297c01","n":"0297c","t":"說不依真事此總結之述曰此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0298b01","n":"0298b","t":"生位二二乘有學位三二乘無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0298c01","n":"0298c","t":"變列其數也束三能變合為二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0299a01","n":"0299a","t":"熟之果顯其因性但舉此因能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0299b01","n":"0299b","t":"非因所生皆名為果不爾種子"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0299c01","n":"0299c","t":"主引生故由強勝業引總果故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0300a01","n":"0300a","t":"名異熟有漏種子皆名異熟生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0300b01","n":"0300b","t":"問頌文何故如是次第答曰宗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0300c01","n":"0300c","t":"別開者束五受門相應中攝俱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0301a01","n":"0301a","t":"種種名所藏此識是能藏是雜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0301b01","n":"0301b","t":"二義為體名攝問若爾自相應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0301c01","n":"0301c","t":"分別論者別有有分識等為勝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0302a01","n":"0302a","t":"共此諍真異熟故偏說之此明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0302b01","n":"0302b","t":"持義下執受中自當廣說述曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0302c01","n":"0302c","t":"持種親生自果簡異熟因望所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0303a01","n":"0303a","t":"非果生非是因即於法上假施"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0303b01","n":"0303b","t":"誠文同此此則通說一切有漏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0304b01","n":"0304b","t":"皆許故前約本有等義此約新"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0305b01","n":"0305b","t":"習氣異名習氣之法必由熏有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0305c01","n":"0305c","t":"緣緣種子生與此文同述曰又"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0306c01","n":"0306c","t":"有新熏若爾設俱新熏豈俱新"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0307a01","n":"0307a","t":"妨答曰不然佛說無一法非因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0307b01","n":"0307b","t":"言常為種子於理何妨述曰即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0307c01","n":"0307c","t":"此有信等者應非善心無信等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0308b01","n":"0308b","t":"汝寧全撥無本有種若爾何須"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0308c01","n":"0308c","t":"種若無有漏聞熏習者無漏之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T43n1830_p0309b01","n":"0309b","t":"盛故諸法師等皆言護法解脫"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T43n1830-成唯識論述記卷002b","source":"CBETA T43n1830 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":130,"unit":"T43 頁欄"}